# Operro Migration Index (0001–0012)

Status: **validated engine**, applied in order on Postgres 16.
Frozen architecture layers: **Identity → Security → Operational → Commercial → Financial → Cross-Cutting.**
Two schemas: `app` (infra, hidden from PostgREST) and `public` (business).

Do not build 0013+ here — those are Increment 1 scope, tracked in
`00_HANDOFF_FOR_CODEX.md` §7, not part of this validated bundle.

